jafgen-0.4.14 wheel that ran, and to LICENSE at tag v0.4.14 of the source repository.
Neither that wheel nor that tag ships a NOTICE file.

The fixed text named above appears in the data because jafgen's source contains it.
To whatever extent that text is part of jafgen, it is covered by jafgen's license, which
is why the license ships beside the data. This file makes no broader claim about the
data than that.
